{"version":1,"content":"<p>新皇崗口岸上周末深夜大塞車。</p><p>繼政務司長陳國基昨主持跨部門工作小組會議後，特區政府今日（29日）公布，與深圳市相關部門達成共識，深圳灣口岸的旅客和客車清關服務會於10月30及31日一連兩晚延長服務兩小時，延至翌日凌晨二時。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:52.116840+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.594069+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.849653+00:00","content_hash":"7e9c3e99771ac1a03c84eec8bf617ffcd31badf0d1cb5bacb9c33919846efa8c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}